**AI Assistant:** I can calculate the determinant! The determinant of a \( 3 \times 3 \) matrix can be computed using the formula:
\[
\det(A) = a(ei - fh) - b(di - fg) + c(dh - eg)
\]
where \( A = \begin{bmatrix}
a & b & c \\
d & e & f \\
g & h & i
\end{bmatrix} \).

For our matrix \( A \):
