- First calculate \( ei - fh \):
\[
(-1)(-k) - (-1)(1) = k + 1
\]

- Then \( di - fg \):
\[
k(-k) - (-1)(1) = -k^2 + 1
\]

- And finally \( dh - eg \):
\[
k(1) - (-1)(1) = k + 1
\]

